# Manual Elasticsearch inspection and snapshot restore examples for a local instance.
@elasticsearchUrl = http://localhost:9200
@repository = replace-with-snapshot-repository
@snapshot = replace-with-snapshot-name
@sourceIndices = replace-with-source-index-pattern

### Inspect development indexes
GET {{elasticsearchUrl}}/_cat/indices/dev-*?v

### List snapshots in an existing repository
GET {{elasticsearchUrl}}/_cat/snapshots/{{repository}}?v

### Inspect a snapshot before choosing sourceIndices
GET {{elasticsearchUrl}}/_snapshot/{{repository}}/{{snapshot}}

### Restore selected indexes with a dev- prefix
POST {{elasticsearchUrl}}/_snapshot/{{repository}}/{{snapshot}}/_restore?wait_for_completion=false
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "include_global_state": false,
    "indices": "{{sourceIndices}}",
    "rename_pattern": "(.+)",
    "rename_replacement": "dev-$1",
    "index_settings": {
        "index.number_of_replicas": 0
    }
}
